<p>Iran is moving to appoint a new supreme leader after Ayatollah Ali Khamenei was killed in a US-Israeli strike on his compound, and multiple outlets say his son, Mojtaba Khamenei, has emerged as a leading contender in the succession process. Some reports went further, claiming the Assembly of Experts has already chosen Mojtaba—something Iran has publicly denied. That push-and-pull highlights how much remains unclear about what, if anything, has been decided behind closed doors, and when a formal announcement might come. The Guardian reported that officials have offered no confirmation and that any announcement could wait until after the postponed funeral. Several accounts describe Mojtaba Khamenei as a hardline insider who has built influence through close ties with Iran’s clerical establishment and the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC), with some sources saying the IRGC is pressing for his elevation. Iran has also outlined public mourning plans: one report described a multi-day farewell ceremony in Tehran and said a funeral procession would be announced later, after authorities postponed a planned state funeral citing expectations of exceptionally large crowds.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/JVZMJXp6GcZYZhnQ_Eb2yRxqRuRaqNf5PjyfHZqTv5fK604OYdqJ6leKSy_KilI2uQMKB43OxQNtEQJoUxqngOChZs1VVdlgWCN95TluT6IgQanbigruXL6sG-UatP-SZADS68hTToNaB4y4VpsCDTokj_8Vjgqh1cJ_350hpqWeHWztAa2LSJz8CTkeAzhG291eqdUBvNJCnfLqPrgjlA' alt='Mojtaba Khamenei, son of the slain former leader of Iran, in Tehran in 2019.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Timing uncertainty: Iran has not confirmed a successor, and one report said a formal announcement could wait until after the postponed funeral.</li><li>Profile detail: Mojtaba Khamenei is described as a 56-year-old hardliner who spent years building ties within the clerical establishment and the Revolutionary Guards.</li><li>Family losses reported: One account said Mojtaba’s wife, mother and son were also killed in the Feb 28 US-Israeli attacks.</li><li>Survival claims: Two Iranian sources cited by Reuters said Mojtaba Khamenei survived US and Israeli airstrikes that killed his father.</li><li>Mourning schedule detail: Reporting described a Tehran farewell ceremony expected to run for three days, with the funeral procession to be announced later.</li></ul><blockquote>Every leader appointed by the Iranian terror regime to continue and lead the plan to destroy Israel, to threaten the United States and the free world and the countries of the region, and to suppress the Iranian people - will be a target for elimination - Israel Katz</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Iranian authorities: Iran has denied reports that Mojtaba Khamenei has already been chosen as supreme leader, even as it says it wants to appoint a successor quickly. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/mojtaba-son-of-ayatollah-ali-khamenei-elected-irans-new-supreme-leader-report-11165865#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>)</li><li>Israeli government: Defence Minister Israel Katz warned publicly that whoever Iran selects as the next supreme leader will be a target for assassination, and separate reports say Israel struck a building associated with Iran’s Assembly of Experts. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/israel-says-whoever-is-chosen-as-irans-next-supreme-leader-will-be-target-for-elimination/article70702487.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Analysts cited by media: One analyst quoted in reporting said choosing Mojtaba Khamenei would likely signal a win for hard-liners, while another report suggested a family succession could anger Iranians seeking change. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/03/world/middleeast/iran-mojtaba-khamenei-successor.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>US administration: President Trump pledged US protection for oil and gas shipping through the Strait of Hormuz, a key global energy chokepoint. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/industry-news/energy-and-resources/article-markets-calmer-after-trump-vows-to-protect-oil-and-gas-ships-at-the/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/b71ef4e2-d008-49fd-99f8-3c89fdab0d9f'>Ali Khamenei’s son Mojtaba emerges as a leading candidate for supreme leader of Iran</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/ali-khameneis-son-mojtaba-named-irans-new-supreme-leader-13985962.html'>Ali Khamenei&#x27;s son Mojtaba named Iran&#x27;s new Supreme Leader, Iran International reports</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/03/world/middleeast/iran-mojtaba-khamenei-successor.html'>Ayatollah Ali Khamenei’s Son Emerges as Leading Choice to Be His Successor</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/mojtaba-khamenei-seen-possible-next-supreme-leader-has-survived-attacks-iran'>Mojtaba Khamenei, seen as possible next Supreme Leader, has survived attacks on Iran, sources say</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/04/mojtaba-khamenei-son-of-former-supreme-leader-tipped-to-become-irans-next-head-of-state'>Mojtaba Khamenei, son of former supreme leader, tipped to become Iran’s next head of state</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/mojtaba-son-of-ayatollah-ali-khamenei-elected-irans-new-supreme-leader-report-11165865#publisher=newsstand'>Is Khamenei&#x27;s Son Mojtaba New Supreme Leader? Reports Claim, Iran Denies</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/who-is-mojtaba-khamenei-frontrunner-to-be-irans-supreme-leader'>Who is Mojtaba Khamenei, frontrunner to be Iran&#x27;s supreme leader?</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3345381/israel-says-next-leader-iran-also-target-elimination'>Israel says next leader of Iran also a ‘target for elimination’</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/new